description:
This is an official Request for Proposal (RFP) for the EIN Injector Complex A/E Design project at Brookhaven National Labs. Refer to the RFP Letter and attachments for details and proposal submission requirements.&nbsp; 

Amendment 1 is posted to update the RFP letter amendment 1 for highlighted changes, specifically as it relates to the questions due date. The signed SOW is also included to the list of attachments. 

Amendment 2 is posted to incorporate Addendum 1 to the Statement of Work and post responses to the questions submitted in response to this RFP. See attachments section for Addendum 1 and the Q&amp;A responses.
